  Release Notes for 0.4.1

 o BUG-FIX: The AppStream metainfo file shipped with 0.4.0 was
            malformed — an unterminated closing tag — and listed
            0.2.0 a second time as 0.4.0, losing the
            first-public-release history. Software centres could
