 o CHANGE:  Card end-margin widened clear of the overlay scrollbar

 o BUG-FIX: Reference lookup made more robust

 o BUG-FIX: The sidebar's institution line is backfilled once the
            author profile arrives

 o BUG-FIX: A dropped image URL that points at a web page rather than
