 o FEATURE: MCP server, so an AI assistant you already use can search
            and read the library: search, find by DOI, paper records,
            sidecars, PDF text, recently added, and a one-hop
            citation neighbourhood

 o FEATURE: Embedded terminal pane (hamburger → Toggle terminal),
